# Local `act` defaults (read automatically from the repo root).
# NOTE: act only reads lines starting with "-"; inline comments after a
# flag are parsed as arguments, so keep flags on their own bare lines.
#
# Reuse containers / cached actions between runs:
--reuse
--pull=false
--action-offline-mode
# Jobs declare self-hosted labels; map every label to a runner image with
# node+docker so act does not skip them (`-P label=image`, one per label):
-P self-hosted=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
-P Linux=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
-P X64=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
-P fast=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
# git must fail instead of prompting for credentials when a secret is
# missing (a prompt hangs act forever — private sibling clones need
# `act -s GIT_CLONE_PAT=...`):
--env GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0
